  "title": "AVITA Medical to Announce First Quarter 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "VALENCIA, Calif., April 23, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- AVITA Medical ®, Inc. (NASDAQ: RCEL, ASX: AVH), a leading therapeutic acute wound care company, today announced that it will report its first quarter 2026 financial results after the close of the U.S. financial markets on Thursday, May 14, 2026.",
